369	query(penguin(fido)).
370	\end{verbatim}
371	
372	\paragraph{ISR interaction.}
373	ISR~$\approx 0$. Each copy is individually redundant since identical copies remain after removal.
374	ISR correctly diagnoses this degeneration.
